flowchart LR
  J[Jira story] --> RES[Researcher]
  RES --> CP[(ContextPack)]
  CP --> AC[AC extraction] --> GH[Gherkin authoring] --> GATE{AC coverage gate}
  GATE -->|covered| TDP[(TestDesignPack)]
  TDP --> XR[["Xray Cucumber tests<br/>linked is tested by"]]
  TDP --> IMP[Implementer · code agent]
  IMP --> VER{verify} -->|fail| HEAL[Healer] --> VER
  VER -->|done| PR[[Pull request]]
  PR --> CMT["@manso comment"] --> RESP[Responder]
  RESP --> FIX[scoped fix + reply]
  RESP --> LRN[Learning Engine] --> PROP[[Guideline PR]]
